# Every text file of this repository lies with LF, wherever it is checked out: the line endings of the machine which a
# checkout is made on are not the ones a commit carries, so a working tree which differs from the repository in every
# line of every file is a diff which hides the one line that changed. A file which is not text is left as it lies, and
# what the two packages carry that is not text - the generator of either, and the weaver of Godot - is an assembly
# rather than a file which can be read, so those are named here rather than told apart by their content.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.nupkg binary
